@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
title RIASEC local opt-in flow / current source 2026-11-18
component "Overview RIASEC
60 EN/VI activities; raw 0..40 radar
Draft, review, confirmations, filtered history" as UI
component "RiasecController / RiasecService
Trusted Employee org/account
Draft revision/editor, owner lock, stable submit receipt" as API
database "PostgreSQL V72
riasec_workspace / riasec_result
Answers, scores, AI jobs, snapshots, retention" as PG
component "Riasec worker + maintenance
Single global PROCESSING claim
Run/status/deadline fence; timeout / 7-day cleanup" as Worker
component "RiasecCatalog
ACTIVE same-org Job Positions
Six native integers 0..40; no Department filter" as Catalog
database "Neo4j JobPosition
Metadata + six optional all-or-none interests
No personal answers/results" as Graph
component "Private Ollama /api/chat
qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M
Up to 3 supplied IDs; English explanations" as AI
component "Existing published Role browser
Explore more filters jobPositionId
Employee explicitly chooses Role / Level" as Roles
UI --> API : session/CSRF; no client owner/scores
API --> PG : owner transaction / save / submit
PG --> Worker : claim QUEUED job
Worker --> Catalog : current catalog at claim/retry
Catalog --> Graph : trusted organization query
Worker --> AI : only six Employee scores + candidate metadata/profiles
AI --> Worker : IDs / dense ranks / two dimensions / explanation
Worker --> PG : validate; copy original scores; persist snapshot
UI --> Roles : Explore more with current active ID; existing access/lock rules
note bottom of Worker
  QUEUED -> PROCESSING -> SUCCEEDED / FAILED
  Queue 20min; processing 8min; HTTP 7min; maintenance 15sec.
  Success including zero suggestions is final.
  Only current FAILED result can explicitly retry.
  No cosine, chat, Role/Skill/history input or learning-state write.
end note
@enduml
